// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 04-expressions/chained_member_read_capability_neg_67.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A chained member read is legal source: the outer member resolves against the
// inner member's closed nominal type. No field-projection shape roots a
// projection at another projection, so the body slice cannot lower it. The
// checker drains the free-function body with ZOM4099 instead of reaching a
// missing-fact invariant.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4099]: this function body uses a construct the compiler cannot generate code for yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/04-expressions/chained_member_read_capability_neg_67.zom:11:9
// CHECK-LITERAL:    |
// CHECK-LITERAL: 11 |     if (o.inner.ok) { return 1; } else { return 0; }
// CHECK-LITERAL:    |         ^~~~~~~~~~
// CHECK-LITERAL: 1 error generated.
